rior here.\n\nReason: P: d2-d4 is the standard main line against the Owen\'s Defense. It takes full control of the center and prepares to meet Black\'s upcoming ...Bb7 with developing moves like Bd3 or Nc3. It maximizes White\'s space advantage and development potential.\n\nAnswer: P: d2-d4'}
